ages remain unspecified.'), ('E.17', 'Proved', 'The actual published DLL targets N0,N1,N2 have their full practical/charming shadow sets independently enumerated and their pentagons verified.', ['C4 §53 action formulas; prompt E(d) literature examples'], ['E.14', 'E.16', 'DolgushevLeLorenz2024, Table 1', 'Dolgushev2022PackageGT'], False, 'PB4 orders 8, 8, 12; B3 orders 192, 192, 648; practical counts 4, 8, 18; charming counts 4, 4, 6. All charming shadows of N0/N1 are genuine. Both first targets induce the same kernel 315, but practical-shadow sets differ. The four extra charming shadows of N2 are not declared genuine.')]
